{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528430/extras/lets_get_cooking_fmc.png?t=1744319758\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a chef in a restaurant, working with other chefs to collect ingredients, prepare a dish, and serve your guest\u2026 who happens to be a giant monster. Use the coins earned from each guest to upgrade your restaurant and future guests. <br><br>Just make sure you have enough coins each morning to pay off the extorting octopus...<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528430/extras/too_many_cooks_fmc.png?t=1744319758\" /><br>Chefs need to work together to finish the dish on time. Throw ingredients, platform through obstacles, and make sure every chef adds a <i>chef\u2019s kiss</i> for the highest payout.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528430/extras/fast_paced_fmc.png?t=1744319758\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The water is always rising in your restaurant. Move quickly to avoid falling in\u2014or worse, getting eaten by your own guest! Chefs don\u2019t have time to waste\u2026 because if you do, <i>you\u2019ll</i> be the one getting wasted.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2528430?t=1744319758","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2528430?t=1744319758","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528430/2f7e7014313ab38737d6aaa8b0bd6c28d3bd956e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744319758","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528430/2f7e7014313ab38737d6aaa8b0bd6c28d3bd956e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744319758","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528430/extras/lets_get_cooking_fmc.png?t=1744319758\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a chef in a restaurant, working with other chefs to collect ingredients, prepare a dish, and serve your guest\u2026 who happens to be a giant monster. Use the coins earned from each guest to upgrade your restaurant and future guests. <br><br>Just make sure you have enough coins each morning to pay off the extorting octopus...<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528430/extras/too_many_cooks_fmc.png?t=1744319758\" /><br>Chefs need to work together to finish the dish on time. Throw ingredients, platform through obstacles, and make sure every chef adds a <i>chef\u2019s kiss</i> for the highest payout.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528430/extras/fast_paced_fmc.png?t=1744319758\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The water is always rising in your restaurant. Move quickly to avoid falling in\u2014or worse, getting eaten by your own guest! Chefs don\u2019t have time to waste\u2026 because if you do, <i>you\u2019ll</i> be the one getting wasted.</p>","developers":["Unseen Peak"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528430/cec873ca89fe9461abfa0c3c4f4282f3df245610/header.jpg?t=1744319758","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Feed Me Chef","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</str